warning[zero_ptr]: `cast(*u8) 0` is a null pointer
  --> tests/lint/zero_ptr/example.jai:4:10
   |
 4 |     p := cast(*u8) 0;
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `null`
   |
 3   main :: () {
 4 ~     p := null;
 5       print("%\n", p);
   |
   = note: `zero_ptr` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/zero_ptr
